  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4904.04 Change of Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4904.04 Change of Address.\n\n(a) All certificate holders shall notify the department in writing of any change of address.\n\n(b) Written notification shall be sent to the following address:\n\nNH State Fire Marshal’s Office\n\nDivision of Fire Safety\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH 03305\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
